  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Canoptek Court",
    "summary": "The Power Matrix of your army covers these areas:\n\n- your deployment zone, at all times\n- No Man's Land, for the rest of any phase that begins with you controlling half or more of its objective markers\n- the enemy deployment zone, for the rest of any phase that begins with you controlling half or more of its objective markers\n\nWhenever a model in one of your **CANOPTEK** or **CRYPTEK** units attacks, it re-rolls 1s to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls). While that unit is wholly within the army's Power Matrix, it can re-roll any [Hit roll](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) instead.",
